  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You try to force a creature into single combat. One creature you can see within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. If it fails, it has Disadvantage on attack rolls against any creature other than you, and it can’t willingly move to a space more than 30 feet away from you.</p><p>The spell ends if you make an attack roll against another creature, if you cast a spell on an enemy other than the target, if one of your allies damages the target, or if you end your turn more than 30 feet away from it.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-jyjqJWsDKsarWQHe\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect marks the target. Its Disadvantage against your allies and its movement limit are applied by hand.</p></section>",
